      {
        "id": 17677,
        "title": "Classi degli oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149884,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo giochi, dovremo creare molti oggetti simili ma distinti. Ad esempio, numerosi nemici in un livello.</p><p>Ma creare un nuovo oggetto per migliaia di nemici richiederebbe molto tempo e potrebbe causare errori.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy100 = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy100);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149885,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per rendere questo processo meno soggetto a errori e più efficiente, possiamo usare strutture dati chiamate <strong>classi</strong> come modelli.<br /></p><p>Una volta creato un modello con le proprietà che vorremo per tutti gli oggetti simili, possiamo usarlo per creare più rapidamente nuovi oggetti.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149886,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una nuova classe, iniziamo con la parola chiave <code>class</code>, un nome e le parentesi graffe.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>class</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149887,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni volta che creiamo una nuova classe, dobbiamo assicurarci che il nome inizi con una <strong>lettera maiuscola</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"enemy\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Enemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149888,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare nuovi oggetti, le classi hanno bisogno di un metodo speciale chiamato <code>constructor()</code>. Questo metodo imposta i valori delle proprietà per un nuovo oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149889,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ci serve un modo per specificare i valori univoci che avrà un nuovo oggetto. Lo facciamo inviando dei <strong>parametri</strong> al metodo costruttore.</p><p>Qui passeremo <code>type</code> e poi <code>health</code> come parametri al metodo costruttore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"type; health\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>type, health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149890,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa sono le <strong>classi</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Modelli per gli oggetti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Oggetti ben definiti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Modelli per gli oggetti.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149891,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché usiamo le classi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci permettono di creare oggetti più velocemente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sono più brevi da scrivere rispetto agli oggetti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci permettono di creare oggetti più velocemente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149892,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando crei una classe, quale convenzione di denominazione è importante?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I nomi delle classi iniziano con una lettera maiuscola</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è bisogno di un nome di classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I nomi delle classi iniziano con una lettera maiuscola.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149893,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi è il metodo che usiamo all'interno di una classe per creare nuovi oggetti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>constructor</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149894,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I parametri devono trovarsi nel costruttore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una classe può avere un solo parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I parametri devono trovarsi nel costruttore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149895,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una classe per <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149896,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un <code>constructor</code> alla tua classe <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149897,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi alcuni parametri alla classe <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name,</code>, seguito da <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17678,
        "title": "Questo",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di creare una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto di gioco, ci serve una parola chiave speciale: <code>this</code>. Aggiungiamo la parola chiave <code>this</code> per fare riferimento all'oggetto che stiamo creando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto di gioco, devi usare la parola chiave <code>this</code> seguita da un punto e dal nome della proprietà.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per completare la creazione della nuova proprietà dell'oggetto di gioco, assegneremo il parametro <code>name</code> come valore di <code>this.name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>name</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>È il momento di usare la nostra classe. Iniziamo come faremmo per creare una costante, ma poi aggiungiamo la parola chiave <code>new</code> seguita da <code>Player()</code>.</p><p>Qui assegnerai <code>new Player()</code> alla costante <code>player1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new</code>, seguito da <code>Player</code> e infine <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo quindi aggiungere tra parentesi i valori che vogliamo impostare per il nuovo giocatore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ecco fatto! Ora possiamo usare le classi per creare facilmente tutti i giocatori che vogliamo, con molto meno codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blaze&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la parola chiave che dobbiamo specificare in una classe per indicare al codice che ci stiamo riferendo all'oggetto di gioco che stiamo creando?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>class</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una classe ha una proprietà <code>score</code>. Come vi accediamo quando ci troviamo all'interno della classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con <code>this.score</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con <code>this(score)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con <code>this.score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale frammento di codice è il modo corretto per creare un nuovo oggetto <code>Enemy</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto chiamata <code>health</code> usando <code>this</code>. Assegna ad essa il valore del parametro <code>health</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>health</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per creare una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto chiamata <code>type</code> usando <code>this</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>this.type</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149909,
